   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1710",
   "x": 2135.3999999999996,
   "y": 1582.0,
   "width": 345.8,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. 経路は用意できているが、使い切れていない",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. 経路は用意できているが、使い切れていない",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11990,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 53048,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1711",
   "x": 2135.3999999999996,
   "y": 1602.0,
   "width": 623.2000000000004,
   "height": 100.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    EngineServices / SystemContext / ObjectContext の3経路は機能している。\n    ただしアプリ側にはまだ直引きが残っている(この図には未掲載):\n    GunShootSystem → ResourceManager / ScoreSystem → GameManager /\n    CameraStartSystem → OptionManager / 各 Sequence → SceneManager\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    EngineServices / SystemContext / ObjectContext の3経路は機能している。\n    ただしアプリ側にはまだ直引きが残っている(この図には未掲載):\n    GunShootSystem → ResourceManager / ScoreSystem → GameManager /\n    CameraStartSystem → OptionManager / 各 Sequence → SceneManager\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 11997,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 53079,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1712",
   "x": 2135.3999999999996,
   "y": 1702.0,
   "width": 513.0000000000002,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. コンポーネントのヘルパーがヘッダーで Instance() を呼んでいる",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. コンポーネントのヘルパーがヘッダーで Instance() を呼んでいる",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12004,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 53110,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1713",
   "x": 2135.3999999999996,
   "y": 1722.0,
   "width": 538.2000000000005,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    ModelComponent / ParticlesComponent / SoundComponent など。\n    コンポーネントは POD なので、取得と返却はシステム側か\n    ComponentTraits::Release 経由に寄せたい。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    ModelComponent / ParticlesComponent / SoundComponent など。\n    コンポーネントは POD なので、取得と返却はシステム側か\n    ComponentTraits::Release 経由に寄せたい。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12011,
